              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "nyayo-beans"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Nyayo Beans"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " are one of the most comforting and economical dishes in Kenya. Kidney beans simmer slowly with a small amount of maize until the whole pot becomes thick and savoury. It feeds a family from very few ingredients."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tinned kidney beans save the soaking and cooking time. If using dried beans, soak overnight and boil until tender before adding them to the stew."
          }
        ]
      },
